# Tests/Screenshots/ IS tracked, but only via Tests/collect_captures.py, which crops and
# quantises a capture to ~300 KB first. GitHub renders raw.githubusercontent URLs inline and
# will not proxy a release asset, so committing is the only way a reviewer sees evidence
# without downloading it — the discipline is on the size, not on the tracking.
